# Performance

Based on patterns already used in `home` and shared widgets.

## Widgets

- Prefer `const` widgets to limit rebuilds.
- Split large `build` methods into small widgets.
- Use `BlocBuilder` with `buildWhen` when only a slice of state should rebuild.

## Lists & pagination

- Use builders (`ListView.builder`, grids) — not eagerly built long `Column` children.
- Paginate with `PaginationParams` and `hasReachedMax` (see `ProductCubit`).
- Cancel in-flight loads via `CancelableSafeCubitMixin` when leaving the page.

## Images & assets

- Remote: `cached_network_image` via shared widgets.
- Static: asset/font declarations in `pubspec.yaml`.
- Always provide error/placeholder handling for network images.

## Network & cache

- Prefer cache-fallback (home) for resilience and fewer blank screens offline.
- Avoid duplicate simultaneous fetches for the same resource without cancellation.
- Keep Hive boxes scoped; do not open unbounded caches.

## Avoid

- Heavy work in `build()`.
- Unbounded `setState` / emit loops.
- Loading full remote lists when pagination exists.
